### Lab 3 – Hospital Triage: HTTP Requests

> **DISCLAIMER**: This is an educational demonstration only. It does not constitute real medical advice.

@workerUrl = http://localhost:8096
@mockApiUrl = http://localhost:8090

### ===== DEPLOY =====

### Deploy BPMN + DMN
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/deploy

### ===== TOPOLOGY =====

### Zeebe Connection Check
GET {{workerUrl}}/workflow/topology

### ===== TC-L3-01: ROUTINE PATIENT (LOW PRIORITY) =====

### Expected: Triage=LOW → "Book Appointment" worker → appointment booked
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientRef": "SYN-PAT-001",
  "appointmentPreference": "MORNING",
  "symptomsSummary": "Mild headache for 2 days, no fever",
  "chestPain": false,
  "breathingDifficulty": false,
  "feverDays": 0,
  "painScore": 2
}

### ===== TC-L3-02: MODERATE PATIENT =====

### Expected: Triage=MEDIUM → appointment + possible consultation
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientRef": "SYN-PAT-002",
  "appointmentPreference": "AFTERNOON",
  "symptomsSummary": "Persistent fever for 4 days with moderate pain",
  "chestPain": false,
  "breathingDifficulty": false,
  "feverDays": 4,
  "painScore": 6
}

### ===== TC-L3-03: URGENT PATIENT (CHEST PAIN) =====

### Expected: Triage=URGENT → "Urgent Clinical Assessment" user task
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientRef": "SYN-PAT-003",
  "appointmentPreference": "MORNING",
  "symptomsSummary": "Chest pain and shortness of breath since 2 hours",
  "chestPain": true,
  "breathingDifficulty": true,
  "feverDays": 0,
  "painScore": 8
}

### ===== TC-L3-04: NO SLOTS AVAILABLE =====

### First disable slots, then start routine patient → "Staff Slot Review" user task
# Step 1: Disable slots
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/slots-availability
Content-Type: application/json

{"available": false}

###
# Step 2: Start a routine patient request
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientRef": "SYN-PAT-004-NOSLOT",
  "appointmentPreference": "MORNING",
  "symptomsSummary": "Routine checkup requested",
  "chestPain": false,
  "breathingDifficulty": false,
  "feverDays": 0,
  "painScore": 1
}

###
# Step 3: Re-enable slots (restore normal operation)
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/slots-availability
Content-Type: application/json

{"available": true}

### ===== SCHEDULING API DIRECT CALL =====

### Direct slot availability check (bypasses process)
GET {{mockApiUrl}}/scheduling/slots?preference=MORNING

### ===== FAILURE INJECTION =====

### Enable scheduling API failure mode
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable scheduling API failure mode
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Enable worker failure mode
POST {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable worker failure mode
POST {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### ===== STATUS =====

GET {{mockApiUrl}}/health
GET {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/status
GET {{workerUrl}}/actuator/health
GET {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/status

